# NFR-17: output and fixtures are LF-only. Without this, a Windows checkout
# (GitHub's runners set core.autocrlf=true) turns text fixtures into CRLF and
# byte-comparing tests fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary

# Golden files are compared byte for byte: git must never convert them.
tests/golden/** -text
